    {
      "id": "note-overview",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -680,
        "y": -300
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Each sequence is 10 tokens long. The answer token (one of 10 classes) sits at position 0; the other 9 positions are random distractors. The model reads the whole sequence and has to name the first token at the end, so it must carry that one token through 9 steps of noise in its hidden state. Test accuracy climbs from chance (0.10) to 1.0 in 15 epochs, on CPU, with no download.\n\n每條序列長 10 個 token。答案 token（10 類之一）放在第 0 個位置，其餘 9 個位置都是隨機干擾。模型讀完整條序列後，要在最後說出第一個 token 是什麼，所以得把那一個 token 存在 hidden state 裡帶過 9 步的雜訊。測試準確率在 15 個 epoch 內從亂猜（0.10）爬到 1.0，用 CPU 就能跑，不需要下載。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "start",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -420,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 360
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-model",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 40,
        "y": 620
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Open the layer editor: Embedding (20 tokens -> 16-d) -> LSTM (hidden 64) -> SelectIndex (dim 1, index -1, the last time step) -> Linear (64 -> 10). Raise seq_len to 30 on both generators and rerun: with the same data and epochs the model memorises the training set and stays at chance on the test set, because the dependency is now 29 steps long.\n\n打開圖層編輯器：Embedding（20 種 token -> 16 維）-> LSTM（hidden 64）-> SelectIndex（dim 1、index -1，取最後一個時間步）-> Linear（64 -> 10）。把兩個產生器的 seq_len 都改成 30 再跑一次：同樣的資料量和 epoch 數下，模型會背下訓練集，測試集卻停在亂猜，因為依賴距離變成 29 步。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "model",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 200
        },
        "noteWidth": 280
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-test",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -300,
        "y": 40
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "The test set comes from the same generator with seed 1, so it holds sequences the model never trained on. Set kind to recall_last on both generators and the task becomes trivial: the answer is the last token read.\n\n測試集來自同一個產生器，但 seed 設為 1，所以裡面都是模型沒看過的序列。把兩個產生器的 kind 都改成 recall_last，任務就變得很簡單：答案就是最後讀到的那個 token。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "seq-test",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -340,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    }
